<title>ITALY: MOTOR RACING-SCHUMACHER WINS ITALIAN GRAND PRIX.</title>
<headline>MOTOR RACING-SCHUMACHER WINS ITALIAN GRAND PRIX.</headline>
<dateline>MONZA, Italy 1996-09-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Germany's Michael</p>
<p>Schumacher, driving a Ferrari, won the Italian Grand Prix motor</p>
<p>race on Sunday.</p>
<p>Frenchman Jean Alesi finished second in a Benetton with Mika</p>
<p>Hakkinen of Finland third in a McLaren.</p>
<p>Britain's Martin Brundle finished fourth ahead of Jordan</p>
<p>team mate Rubens Barrichello of Brazil in fifth. Brazil's Pedro</p>
<p>Diniz finished sixth in a Ligier.</p>
</text>
